#: df87a3241958453f8634b184de4023a5
msgid "Connect the CAM_SYNC wire (shown in blue in the image above) from the camera to one of the autopilot's AUX OUT signal pins (e.g. AUX OUT 6's bottom row pin)"
msgstr ""

