#: 1d72a77abbe54c0e9dc84a1793f44a5b
msgid ":ref:`SERVO13_FUNCTION <SERVO13_FUNCTION>` to -1 (GPIO) (if connected to AUX OUT 5)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-xacti-gimbal.rst:80
#: e23a89eca2944f34952c8967fc0b113a
msgid "The camera can be powered off/on using an :ref:`auxiliary switch <common-auxiliary-functions>` set to \"Relay 1 On/Off\" or Mission Planner's Aux Function screen can be used.  Pulling the relay high will turn the camera off, low will turn it back on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-xacti-gimbal.rst:88
#: e69f14b6244c478787819baf3bd95846
msgid "When the autopilot first detects the Xacti gimbal the :ref:`MNT1_DEVID<MNT1_DEVID>` will be set to a unique number to identify the gimbal.  If the gimbal is moved to another CAN port it may be necessary to manually set :ref:`MNT1_DEVID<MNT1_DEVID>` to zero and reboot the autopilot in order for the gimbal to be found."
msgstr ""

